The French adversary and environment descriptions and features in
`data/adversaries.json` and `data/environments.json` incorporate adapted
materials from the community module "Daggerheart DRS - Français (non officiel)"
by Sasmira, licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0
(AGPL-3.0):

  Source repository: https://gitlab.com/sasmira/daggerheart-fr-foundryborne
  Modifications made: Converted Foundry VTT journal/actor HTML and @UUID/@Lookup
  tokens into static JSON entries for Daggerborne, unified SRD 2.0 terminology,
  and stripped non-SRD tags.

Because these AGPL-3.0 JSON datasets are bundled and distributed with this
application, the combined distribution and source repository are made available
in compliance with the GNU AGPL-3.0 terms (with the complete source code
available in this repository alongside the full AGPL-3.0 license text at
https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.txt). Note that the underlying
Daggerheart SRD 2.0 game rules and mechanics remain subject to Part 2 (DPCGL).
